<PageTitle>About — Blazor Atoms</PageTitle>

<h1>About Blazor Atoms</h1>

<p><strong>BlazorAtoms.BusyIndicators</strong> is a Razor Class Library (RCL) of pure-CSS/SVG
   animated busy indicators for Blazor — Server or WebAssembly. No JavaScript, no dependency injection,
   no runtime dependencies.</p>

<h2>Two form-factors</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Round <code>AtomBusy*</code> indicators</strong> — <code>AtomBusyFunnel</code>, <code>AtomBusySwarm</code>,
        <code>AtomBusyMagnifier</code>, <code>AtomBusyGears</code>, <code>AtomBusyNeural</code>, <code>AtomBusyHourglass</code>,
        <code>AtomBusyDna</code>. Rendered through the <code>&lt;AtomBusyIndicator&gt;</code> wrapper, which discovers
        them by reflection — drop in a new <code>AtomBusy*</code> component and it shows up automatically.</li>
    <li><strong>Linear <code>AtomPulse*</code> indicators</strong> — <code>AtomPulseBar</code>, <code>AtomPulseScanner</code>.
        Self-contained (each builds its own scoped SVG), rich per-component parameters, used directly.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Highlights</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Pure CSS animation — works without any JS interop.</li>
    <li>Themeable via <code>--ind-*</code> CSS custom properties, with built-in light/dark defaults.</li>
    <li>Honors <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code> (freezes the animation).</li>
    <li>Culture-safe SVG output (invariant number formatting).</li>
    <li>Trimming / WASM-AOT safe.</li>
</ul>

